.* CMDDSTSRV: Distribution Services Commands, a group of the major command menu.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CMDDSTSRV'.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDDSTSRV HELP=HLPCMDDSTSRV KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' PANELID=PANELID.Distribution Services Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Commands
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?ADDDSTQ'.
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?ADDDSTRTE'.
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?ADDDSTSYSN'.
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?CFGDSTSRV'.
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?CHGDSTQ'.
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?CHGDSTRTE'.
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?DSPDSTLOG'.
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?DSPDSTSRV'.
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD ?HLDDSTQ'.
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?INZDSTQ'.
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='CMD ?RLSDSTQ'.
:MENUI OPTION=12 ACTION='CMD ?RMVDSTQ'.
:MENUI OPTION=13 ACTION='CMD ?RMVDSTRTE'.
:MENUI OPTION=14 ACTION='CMD ?RMVDSTSYSN'.
:MENUI OPTION=15 ACTION='CMD ?SNDDSTQ'.
:MENUI OPTION=16 ACTION='CMD ?WRKDIRE'.
:MENUI OPTION=17 ACTION='CMD ?WRKDSTQ'.
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Related Command Menus
:MENUI HELP='CMDDSTSRV/OPT18' OPTION=18 ACTION='MENU CMDCMNMGT'.Communication Mgmt Commands  CMDCMNMGT
:MENUI HELP='CMDDSTSRV/OPT19' OPTION=19 ACTION='MENU CMDDOC'.Document Commands  CMDDOC
:MENUI HELP='CMDDSTSRV/OPT20' OPTION=20 ACTION='MENU CMDMSF'.Mail Server Framework Commands  CMDMSF
:MENUI HELP='CMDDSTSRV/OPT21' OPTION=21 ACTION='MENU CMDNET'.Network Commands  CMDNET
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDDSTSRV.Distribution Services Commands - Help
:P.Distribution Services Commands: the commands and the command menus of
this group, as the major command menu arranges them, with each name at
the right of its row. A blank row is a command this release does not
provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command or show the
menu, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous
menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command
groups.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F16=Major menu
:PD.Shows menu MAJOR.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDDSTSRV/OPT18'.Communication Mgmt Commands  CMDCMNMGT
:P.Option 18. Shows menu CMDCMNMGT&colon. Communication Mgmt Commands
CMDCMNMGT.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDDSTSRV/OPT19'.Document Commands  CMDDOC
:P.Option 19. Shows menu CMDDOC&colon. Document Commands CMDDOC.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDDSTSRV/OPT20'.Mail Server Framework Commands  CMDMSF
:P.Option 20. Shows menu CMDMSF&colon. Mail Server Framework Commands
CMDMSF.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDDSTSRV/OPT21'.Network Commands  CMDNET
:P.Option 21. Shows menu CMDNET&colon. Network Commands CMDNET.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
